WEBVTT

00:00:02.315 --> 00:00:05.753
[exhales] I probably
sucked more today

00:00:05.884 --> 00:00:07.886
than anyone in
the history of kung fu.

00:00:08.016 --> 00:00:11.541
In the history of China.
In the history of sucking!

00:00:11.672 --> 00:00:14.022
- Probably.
- And the Five!

00:00:14.153 --> 00:00:16.546
Man, you should've seen them!
They totally hate me.

00:00:16.677 --> 00:00:21.856
- Totally.
- How is Shifu ever going to
turn me into the Dragon Warrior?

00:00:23.858 --> 00:00:25.555
I mean, I'm not like the Five.

00:00:25.686 --> 00:00:29.385
I've got no claws,
no wings, no venom.

00:00:29.516 --> 00:00:32.562
Even Mantis has those...
thingies.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:37.567
Maybe I should just quit
and go back to making noodles.

00:00:40.527 --> 00:00:42.746
Quit, don't quit.

00:00:42.877 --> 00:00:46.707
Noodles, don't noodles.

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:51.494
You are too concerned with
what was and what will be.

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:53.409
There's a saying:

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.934
Yesterday is history,

00:00:56.064 --> 00:00:58.458
tomorrow is a mystery,

00:00:58.588 --> 00:01:01.504
but today is a gift.

00:01:01.635 --> 00:01:04.768
That is why
it is called the present.

00:01:21.524 --> 00:01:23.875
[breathing deeply]

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.227
[grunting]

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.800
- Oh, no!
- What's happening?!

00:01:36.931 --> 00:01:39.716
[man] To your battle stations!
Go! Go! Go!

00:01:41.022 --> 00:01:42.719
[snarling]

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:49.813
Fire crossbows!

00:01:49.944 --> 00:01:51.467
Fire!

00:01:53.905 --> 00:01:55.123
Fire!

00:02:02.435 --> 00:02:05.133
Tai Lung is free!
I must warn Shifu.

00:02:05.264 --> 00:02:08.136
- You're not going anywhere!
Neither is he!
- Let go of me!

00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:09.572
Bring it up!

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:13.925
Wait! Bring it back!

00:02:27.416 --> 00:02:28.591
[neck cracking]

00:02:32.378 --> 00:02:36.077
- He's coming this way!
- He won't get far. Archers!

00:02:51.527 --> 00:02:53.573
[both laughing]

00:03:03.409 --> 00:03:07.979
- [indistinct shouting]
- [snarling]

00:03:36.572 --> 00:03:38.966
[snarling]

00:03:39.097 --> 00:03:40.750
[both growling]

00:03:40.881 --> 00:03:42.143
Ahh!

00:03:44.102 --> 00:03:48.062
We're dead.
So very, very dead.

00:03:48.193 --> 00:03:50.325
Not yet we're not. Now!

00:04:05.036 --> 00:04:07.821
- [snarling]
- [all gasp]

00:04:10.345 --> 00:04:13.044
[laughing]

00:04:37.677 --> 00:04:40.723
- Can we run now?
- Yes.

00:04:43.204 --> 00:04:46.033
[all screaming]

00:04:49.689 --> 00:04:51.386
[groaning]

00:04:57.566 --> 00:05:03.006
- [swallows loudly]
- [breathing deeply]
I'm glad Shifu sent you.

00:05:05.139 --> 00:05:07.924
I was beginning to think
I'd been forgotten.

00:05:08.055 --> 00:05:09.883
Fly back there
and tell them...

00:05:10.013 --> 00:05:14.017
...the real Dragon Warrior
is coming home.

00:05:16.063 --> 00:05:19.327
[shuddering, panting]

